// Test: SCOPE clause with #flag
// Verifies that the flag is carried over to the Schematron output

---- STAGE 1a ----

WITH BT-00-Text
    ASSERT BT-00-Text is present
    AS ERROR R-K7P-M2Q
    FOR BT-00-Text IN 1 SCOPE #lawfulness

    REPORT empty(BT-00-Text)
    AS WARNING R-X3F-N8W
    FOR BT-00-Text IN 1
